      "description": "<p>The Sickened and Unconscious conditions from putrid plague don't improve on their own until the disease is cured.</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 14 Fortitude Saving Throw</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> carrier with no ill effect (1d4 hours)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> Sickened 1 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> Sickened 1 and Slowed 1 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> Unconscious (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5</strong> dead</p>",
